Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.61,0:00:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau berhasil melewati lantai ini,\Nsisanya tinggal Aula Inti dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penjaga lantai 9!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.26,0:00:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanpa ampun, kita serang serentak!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kuduga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya ketemu juga, tengkorak sialan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Utang pertarungan di udara tempo hari...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan kubalas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill Unik Kesatria Sihir: Pemusatan Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Overboost Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pedang Elemen: Angin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teknik Ahli Pedang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.36,0:00:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Impact Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.89,0:01:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jurus ini membuat pertahanan kita\Nbanyak celah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus hati-hati kapan menggunakannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan!\NPokoknya jangan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.13,0:01:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus menang!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski sudah diserang dengan sihir kuat,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia nyaris tak terluka.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Urushi, kamu lawan kuda itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.82,0:01:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berat sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan!\NFran, kamu baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari statusnya saja, musuh jauh lebih kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski sudah ditingkatkan\Ndengan sihir dan skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan dibantu Master,\NFran masih kesulitan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Urushi juga kelihatan kesulitan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?\NZirahnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini kekuatan penjaga dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Undead tak bisa merasakan sakit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}luka ringan bisa pulih sendiri,\Ndan tidak merasa lelah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih belum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master, kita yang rugi\Nkalau bertarung terlalu lama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:04:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill: Pendeteksi Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia mengganggu deteksiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial! Sulit membalikkan keadaan\Nsambil mengincar Batu Sihir-nya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan cari celah sambil terus melawannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa boleh buat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma goresan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Efek serangannya punya\Npeluang kecil mati seketika.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski tidak 100%, tetap bahaya kalau\Ntidak pakai perlengkapan Kucing Hitam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus berterima kasih ke Garrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus serang!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangan Sihir Otomatis?\NDia punya skill seperti itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar aku yang memulihkan kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak sakit, tapi merepotkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill Perisai Sihir telah naik\Nke level tertinggi: 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pakai poin Evolusi Diri\Nagar level Perisai Sihir kita maksimum!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.09,0:06:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master, kamu memang hebat!\NKita bisa melawannya tanpa ragu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir Petir: Stun Bolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.39,0:06:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Efek lumpuhnya tidak mempan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begini terus, kita yang akan kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus cari kelemahannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran, kamu menyadarinya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, dia terus melindungi kepalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batu Sihirnya mungkin ada di kepalanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, pertahanannya sangat kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Urushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana, Fran?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimengerti!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang: Switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka ganti lawan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batu Sihir Kuda Tengkorak ada di lehernya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dragon Fang!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyerapan Batu Sihir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}High Undead ternyata memiliki perasaan\Nyang mirip dengan manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus bertaruh, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sonic Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu Katapel Telekinesis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadikan poin XP ini untuk Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:08:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master, dia...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tekanan serangan pedangnya\Nmeningkat drastis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial, apa yang dia lakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Identifikasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Status Pelepasan Potensi Tersembunyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memaksa pelepasan kekuatan tersembunyi pengguna
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan meningkatkan kemampuan secara sementara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.57,0:09:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi selama digunakan, HP terus berkurang
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan harus menanggung efek tertentu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kekuatan dan kelincahannya melebihi 1.000?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.37,0:09:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Greater Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:09:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih bisa bergerak?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.27,0:10:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, sudah pulih.\NBagaimana dengan Urushi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia akan menyerang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat.\NFran, menjauh darinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Musnahlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir Dunia Bawah: Reverse Undead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kuduga.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir yang harusnya bisa memusnahkan\NHigh Undead ternyata tidak mempan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Greater Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya mustahil untuk menang sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini Pelepasan Potensi Tersembunyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran, kita harus rampas skill-nya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, ayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Urushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill Taker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gagal merebut skill\NPelepasan Potensi Tersembunyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?\NBukannya pasti berhasil?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill target gagal dirampas karena\Nmerupakan skill ekstra dengan tingkat setara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat ini, hanya skill yang lebih rendah\Ndari skill ekstra yang bisa dirampas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?\NSial!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baik-baik saja...\NMasih bisa bertarung.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begini terus,\NFran tak akan sanggup bertahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial, aku harus bagaimana?\NApa ada cara lain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.81,0:12:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku harus pakai\NKatapel Telekinesis sekali lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, lawan secepat dia tak akan mempan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master, naikkan level skill\NTeknik Ahli Pedang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau terus begini, kita tak akan menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teknik Ahli Pedang naik ke level 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran, maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku malah memikirkan diri sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal kita partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.05,0:13:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dan Master adalah partner terkuat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tubuhku jadi ringan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergerakanku juga makin efisien.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, kekuatanku terus meningkat\Nsaat Fran mengayunkanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sensasi apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu hebat, Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master, sepertinya kita\Nbisa melakukannya sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jurus andalan kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah mengeluarkan jurus ini,\Npertahanan kita akan rapuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus gunakan di momen yang tepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master, aku sudah memikirkan\Njurus andalan kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini... lalu begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan! Kalau begitu,\Nmalah akan membebani tubuhmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jurus itu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.91,0:14:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, kalau tidak menggunakannya,\Nkita tak akan menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, tubuhmu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.74,0:14:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan cemas, biarkan aku melakukannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu.\NBaiklah, ayo kita lakukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pemusatan Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.35,0:14:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.69,0:14:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Overboost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.27,0:14:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pedang Elemen: Angin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.85,0:14:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasakan ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teknik Ahli Pedang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Impact Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.19,0:14:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gunakan Telekinesis untuk menghentikan\Ntebasan Impact Slash secara paksa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tambah lagi dengan Telekinesis!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:15:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Heavy Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?\NDia menghindar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak akan kubiarkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memanjanglah! Perubahan Bentuk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Utang saat di udara... sudah kubalas...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kondisimu?\NMasih sakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang sudah pulih.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jurus andalan kita berhasil!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menjaga dan overprotektif itu\Nmemang berbeda,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kalau terus begini,\Ndia akan gila bertarung.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bertarung.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadi itu luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.98,0:16:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jean dan Urushi juga sudah membantu.\NTerima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadi itu pertarungan sulit,\Ntapi aku dapat 300 poin Batu Sihir,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}skill Pengganggu Identifikasi,\NSerangan Sihir Otomatis,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lalu Skill Ekstra:\NPelepasan Potensi Tersembunyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu skill yang sangat kuat,\Ntapi ada efek bagi penggunanya
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan HP akan terus berkurang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.56,0:16:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak bisa sembarangan mencobanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengguna tombak yang tadi sudah kamu ambil,\Nsekarang mau ambil yang itu juga?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya ini punya nilai yang sangat tinggi\Nsebagai bahan sihir necromancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi tidak sabar dipakai untuk apa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa malah ketawa?\NKamu menyeramkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan ambil zirah orichalcum\Ndan jubahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:17:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak butuh pedang sihir, jadi ambillah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini Pedang Sihir Death Gaze.\NKamu yakin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.54,0:17:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sampai terkena tebasannya,\Nkamu bisa langsung mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, kami akan ambil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melihat reaksi kuda tengkorak itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa tubuhnya masih menyimpan perasaan\Nterhadap rekannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau itu hanya sisa dendam\Nyang masih melekat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin itu sebabnya dia terasa\Njauh lebih kuat dibanding undead lainnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, dia musuh yang sangat kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jreng!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daging bekal ini enak banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan sekadar ayam goreng\Nyang dibuat dari daging monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini monster goreng!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makan yang banyak, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang paling pas kalau ditambah kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:17:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa cuma Jean yang dapat kari?\NKenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya dia terus memintaku membuatkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.31,0:18:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga mau!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, iya.\NBaiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, pertarungan tadi sangat berat, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak masuk ke sini, Fran naik 3 level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Urushi malah naik 5 level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah. Master, bisa keluarkan\Nkotak yang waktu itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.11,0:18:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.45,0:18:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jean, ini apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tongkat Sihir: Berkat Hades.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm? Tapi tak bisa dicek dengan Identifikasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini item khusus yang kudapat\Ndi suatu dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Item terkutuk ini menguras HP penggunanya,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi sepertinya pertarungan terakhir\Nsudah dekat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dungeon Master, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:19:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah menyuruh Fry\Nuntuk mencari lokasi inti lantai 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.10,0:19:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keberadaan Fry menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa dia ketahuan musuh lalu dimusnahkan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Musuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, jadi kalian berhasil\Nsampai sejauh ini, para penyusup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian ingin tahu?\NKalau begitu, biar aku yang menjelaskannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sensasi ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aliran sihir ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teleporter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang di ruang inti dungeon ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruang inti?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akulah sang Dungeon Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cukup basa-basinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lenyaplah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Urushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.03,0:20:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.89,0:20:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran!\NHei, Fran!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini skill Ketakutan dan Kepanikan.\NDia memanfaatkan celah mental kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Identifikasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lich?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.26,0:20:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Arwah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kuat, tapi setara Greater Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.29,0:20:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, ini aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasakan aliran mana\Nyang jauh lebih kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, ini Pemalsu Identifikasi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya kamu menyadarinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lawan ini sepertinya bukan tandingan kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.37,0:20:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fran, keluarkan Bulu Penyamaran,\Nkita harus kabur sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:20:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak aktif...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruangan ini memiliki mekanisme\NPenghalang Teleportasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian tidak bisa kabur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan.\NMemangnya ini gim ampas?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Overlord: Undead Summoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang kalian sudah benar-benar putus asa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memanggil enam undead yang kekuatannya
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}setara dengan Kesatria Tengkorak tadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami tidak diberi jalan untuk kabur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.85,0:21:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menyuruh kabur artinya musuh sangat menakutkan\Nsampai membuatmu tak ingin melawannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.63,0:21:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Master dan aku
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.14,0:21:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah partner terkuat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, benar juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.93,0:22:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, kita menangkan pertarungan ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
